<title>POLAND: Polish GPRD to start bourse trade March 3.</title>
<headline>Polish GPRD to start bourse trade March 3.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish road builder  Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA (GPRD) will start bourse trade on March 3, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company will be listed on the bourse's main market.</p>
<p>The late November and early December issue of 2,248,700 shares, priced at 11.2 zlotys per share, was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>GPRD showed a net profit of 4.6 million zlotys in 1995 on sales of 83 million zlotys. It earlier said it expected its pre-tax profit at 10.3 million zlotys in 1996 on revenue of 88.2 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
